    "type": "p",
    "en": "* **Introduction** (p. 75)\n* **Organizational Networks in the Fabric of Communities Facing Disasters** (p. 76)\n  * Social Resilience Processes (p. 76)\n  * Collaboration and Interorganizational Relationships (p. 77)\n  * Networked Models of Stakeholder Relationships (p. 77)\n* **Postdisaster Case Study: Oceanport, New Jersey** (p. 78)\n  * Study Variables (p. 80)\n* **Local Stakeholder Networks in Oceanport, New Jersey** (p. 80)\n  * Network Transitions from Short-term to Long-term Recovery (p. 88)\n  * The National Response Framework in Action (p. 88)\n* **Building Interorganizational Resilience through Networked Collaboration** (p. 88)\n  * Cross-sector Communication and the Plural Sector (p. 89)\n  * Coordinating Resilience Through Brokers (p. 89)\n  * Expanding Policy Frameworks to Account for Local Stakeholder Networks (p. 90)\n  * Implications (p. 90)\n  * Limitations (p. 91)\n* **Conclusions** (p. 91)",
    "ko": "* **서론 (Introduction)** (p. 75)\n* **재난에 직면한 지역사회의 사회적 직조 속 조직 네트워크 (Organizational Networks in the Fabric of Communities Facing Disasters)** (p. 76)\n  * 사회적 레질리언스 프로세스 (Social Resilience Processes) (p. 76)\n  * 협업 및 조직 간 관계 (Collaboration and Interorganizational Relationships) (p. 77)\n  * 이해관계자 관계의 네트워크 모델 (Networked Models of Stakeholder Relationships) (p. 77)\n* **재난 사후 사례 연구: 뉴저지주 오션포트 (Postdisaster Case Study: Oceanport, New Jersey)** (p. 78)\n  * 연구 변수 (Study Variables) (p. 80)\n* **뉴저지주 오션포트의 로컬 이해관계자 네트워크 (Local Stakeholder Networks in Oceanport, New Jersey)** (p. 80)\n  * 단기에서 장기 복구로의 네트워크 전환 (Network Transitions from Short-term to Long-term Recovery) (p. 88)\n  * 실행 중인 국가대응체계 (The National Response Framework in Action) (p. 88)\n* **네트워크 기반 협업을 통한 조직 간 레질리언스 구축 (Building Interorganizational Resilience through Networked Collaboration)** (p. 88)\n  * 부문 간 소통과 다원 부문 (Cross-sector Communication and the Plural Sector) (p. 89)\n  * 브로커를 통한 레질리언스 조정 (Coordinating Resilience Through Brokers) (p. 89)\n  * 로컬 이해관계자 네트워크를 고려한 정책 프레임워크 확장 (Expanding Policy Frameworks to Account for Local Stakeholder Networks) (p. 90)\n  * 정책적·실무적 시사점 (Implications) (p. 90)\n  * 연구의 한계 (Limitations) (p. 91)\n* **결론 (Conclusions)** (p. 91)"
